UID:jPLV53tJoX
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 101 mins (1h41m)\n\nThe story of a family and a fami
 ly business. Benicio del Toro plays tycoon Anatole "Zsa-zsa" Korda\, one o
 f the richest men in Europe\; Mia Threapleton is Sister Liesl\, his daught
 er/a nun\; Michael Cera is Bjorn Lund\, an entomologist.\n\nhttps://www.si
 ff.net/cinema/in-theaters/phoenician-scheme
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
